Type: Package
Package: fitODBOD
Title: Modeling Over Dispersed Binomial Outcome Data Using BMD and ABD
Version: 1.5.3
Authors@R: c(
    person(given="Amalan",family="Mahendran", email="amalan0595@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0643-9052")),
    person(given="Pushpakanthie", family="Wijekoon", role = c("aut", "ctb"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4242-1017"))
  )
Description: Contains Probability Mass Functions, Cumulative Mass
    Functions, Negative Log Likelihood value, parameter estimation and
    modeling data using Binomial Mixture Distributions (BMD) (Manoj et al
    (2013) <doi:10.5539/ijsp.v2n2p24>) and Alternate Binomial
    Distributions (ABD) (Paul (1985) <doi:10.1080/03610928508828990>),
    also Journal article to use the package(<doi:10.21105/joss.01505>).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL:
        https://github.com/Amalan-ConStat/fitODBOD,https://amalan-constat.github.io/fitODBOD/index.html,https://amalan-con-stat.shinyapps.io/fitODBODRshiny/
BugReports: https://github.com/Amalan-ConStat/fitODBOD/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: bbmle, hypergeo, MASS, mvtnorm, Rdpack, stats
RdMacros: Rdpack
Suggests: flextable, ggplot2, ggthemes, grid, gridExtra, knitr,
        reshape2, rmarkdown, spelling, testthat, tibble, viridis
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
LazyData: TRUE
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
NeedsCompilation: no
Packaged: 2024-10-04 14:39:17 UTC; amala
Author: Amalan Mahendran [aut, cre] (<https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0643-9052>),
  Pushpakanthie Wijekoon [aut, ctb]
    (<https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4242-1017>)
Maintainer: Amalan Mahendran <amalan0595@gmail.com>
Repository: CRAN
Date/Publication: 2024-10-10 15:00:12 UTC
Built: R 4.4.1; ; 2024-10-15 11:17:23 UTC; unix
Alcohol_data            Alcohol data
BODextract              Binomial Data Extraction from Raw data
Chromosome_data         Chromosome Data
Course_data             Course Data
Epidemic_Cold           Family Epidemics
EstMGFBetaBin           Estimating the shape parameters a and b for
                        Beta-Binomial Distribution
EstMLEAddBin            Estimating the probability of success and alpha
                        for Additive Binomial Distribution
EstMLEBetaBin           Estimating the shape parameters a and b for
                        Beta-Binomial Distribution
EstMLEBetaCorrBin       Estimating the covariance, alpha and beta
                        parameter values for Beta-Correlated Binomial
                        Distribution
EstMLECOMPBin           Estimating the probability of success and v
                        parameter for COM Poisson Binomial Distribution
EstMLECorrBin           Estimating the probability of success and
                        correlation for Correlated Binomial
                        Distribution
EstMLEGHGBB             Estimating the shape parameters a,b and c for
                        Gaussian Hypergeometric Generalized Beta
                        Binomial Distribution
EstMLEGammaBin          Estimating the shape parameters c and l for
                        Gamma Binomial distribution
EstMLEGrassiaIIBin      Estimating the shape parameters a and b for
                        Grassia II Binomial distribution
EstMLEKumBin            Estimating the shape parameters a and b and
                        iterations for Kumaraswamy Binomial
                        Distribution
EstMLELMBin             Estimating the probability of success and theta
                        for Lovinson Multiplicative Binomial
                        Distribution
EstMLEMcGBB             Estimating the shape parameters a,b and c for
                        McDonald Generalized Beta Binomial distribution
EstMLEMultiBin          Estimating the probability of success and theta
                        for Multiplicative Binomial Distribution
EstMLETriBin            Estimating the mode value for Triangular
                        Binomial Distribution
Exam_data               Exam Data
GenerateBOD             Generate Overdispersed Binomial Outcome Data
Male_Children           Male children data
NegLLAddBin             Negative Log Likelihood value of Additive
                        Binomial distribution
NegLLBetaBin            Negative Log Likelihood value of Beta-Binomial
                        Distribution
NegLLBetaCorrBin        Negative Log Likelihood value of
                        Beta-Correlated Binomial distribution
