NegLLTriBin             Negative Log Likelihood value of Triangular
                        Binomial Distribution
Overdispersion          Overdispersion
Plant_DiseaseData       Plant Disease Incidence data
Terror_data_ARG         Terror Data ARG
Terror_data_USA         Terror Data USA
